
*abs(x)
    x >= 0 ? x ! 0 - x

*main
    log(abs(-10))
    log(abs(10))

    x is 5
    r is x > 3 ? "big" ! "small"
    log(r)

    grade is x > 8 ? "A" ! x > 3 ? "B" ! "C"
    log(grade)

    x > 3 ? log("if-only-yes")
    x < 3 ? log("if-only-no")

    x > 3 ? ! log("qbang-no")
    x < 3 ? ! log("qbang-yes")

    x > 3 ! log("bang-no")
    x < 3 ! log("bang-yes")
